  <Analysis>
    <Title>Adobe License Debugging Audit - oobelib.log - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This analysis reports on the information found within the <FONT size=2>%temp%\oobelib.log file.</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=2>&nbsp;</P></FONT>
<P><STRONG>References:</STRONG></P>
<P><A href="http://helpx.adobe.com/creative-cloud/packager/provisioning-toolkit-enterprise.html">http://helpx.adobe.com/creative-cloud/packager/provisioning-toolkit-enterprise.html</A></P>
