<P>&nbsp;</P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists lines of files &quot;oobelib.log&quot; of ((folders &quot;temp&quot; of windows folders);((folders &quot;AppData\Local\Temp&quot; of folders of folders &quot;Users&quot; of it) of root folders of drives of system folders))</Relevance>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Wed, 16 Jul 2014 23:11:35 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="2" Name="OOBELib: Version" EvaluationPeriod="P7D">unique values of following texts of firsts &quot;  OOBELib: Version &quot; of lines whose(it contains &quot;  OOBELib: Version &quot;) of files &quot;oobelib.log&quot; of ((folders &quot;temp&quot; of windows folders);((folders &quot;AppData\Local\Temp&quot; of folders of folders &quot;Users&quot; of it) of root folders of drives of system folders))</Property>
    <Property ID="3" Name="Adobe LEIDs of file &quot;oobelib.log&quot;" EvaluationPeriod="P7D">unique values of (it as trimmed string) of (if it contains &quot; &quot; then preceding texts of firsts &quot; &quot; of it else it) of (if it starts with &quot;: &quot; then following texts of firsts &quot;: &quot; of it else it) of (if it starts with &quot;is &quot; then following texts of firsts &quot;is &quot; of it else it) of (if it starts with &quot;=&quot; then following texts of firsts &quot;=&quot; of it else it) of (if it contains &quot;, &quot; then preceding texts of firsts &quot;, &quot; of it else it) of (if it contains &quot;{|}&quot; then preceding texts of firsts &quot;{|}&quot; of it else it) of parenthesized parts 1 of matches (regexes &quot; LEI*D* *=*[= ](.+\{\}.+).*&quot;) of lines of files &quot;oobelib.log&quot; of ((folders &quot;temp&quot; of windows folders);((folders &quot;AppData\Local\Temp&quot; of folders of folders &quot;Users&quot; of it) of root folders of drives of system folders))</Property>
    <Property ID="4" Name="Return Codes of file &quot;oobelib.log&quot;" EvaluationPeriod="P2D">unique values whose(it as integer != 0) of parenthesized parts 1 of matches (regexes &quot;return code[: ]\[*([0-9]+)&quot;) of (it as lowercase) of lines whose(it as lowercase contains &quot;return code&quot;) of files &quot;oobelib.log&quot; of ((folders &quot;temp&quot; of windows folders);((folders &quot;AppData\Local\Temp&quot; of folders of folders &quot;Users&quot; of it) of root folders of drives of system folders))</Property>
  </Analysis>
